cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite the tagged release and the evidence number (WN-01 to WN-44) of the note
  you use. See docs/CITATION_GUIDE.md.
title: "SSC Research Evidence"
type: dataset
version: "1.0.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
authors:
  - family-names: Palmer
    given-names: Donald G.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4335-5533"
repository-code: "https://github.com/DonGPalmer/SSC-Research-Evidence"
abstract: >-
  Public editions of the 44 unpublished working notes (WN-01 to WN-44) cited in
  Chapter 15 of The Forgotten Coordinate: Technical Companion, with an evidence
  register and a preparation record giving source and edition hashes. The notes
  were prepared with AI assistance and have not had external scientific review.
